<title>USA: APS sees Q4 oper shr loss $0.30 to $0.35.</title>
<headline>APS sees Q4 oper shr loss $0.30 to $0.35.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>APS Holding Corp Tuesday said it expects to report a loss from continuing operations of between $0.30 and $0.35 per share for the fourth quarter of its 1997 fiscal year.</p>
<p>The company said the predicted loss was a result of the weak automotive aftermarket nationwide, performance issues with its Installers' Service Warehouse division, and higher interest costs.</p>
</text>
